# Project architecture

Mirror the admin panel patterns, adapted for the customer storefront.

## Structure

- `src/app/**/page.tsx` — thin pages: import a feature view, wrap with guards if needed
- `src/features/<domain>/` — UI, API services + React Query hooks, schemas, types
- `src/components/ui/` — reusable DS only; no domain business logic
- `src/lib/api/` — `apiClient`, `queryClient`, `queryHooks`; unwrap `{ success, data, error }`
- `src/stores/` — Zustand for auth / UI / cart only — **not** API cache
- Backend Swagger is source of truth — do not invent API paths; regenerate types

## State

- TanStack Query for server state
- Zustand for small client state only (`useAuthStore`, `useUiStore`, `useCartStore`)
- Session end via `endSession()` — clears tokens + Zustand + `queryClient.clear()`

## UI

- Prefer `App*` components + `semanticColors` / `radius` from `@/theme/designTokens`
- Card shell: `border: 1px solid` + `semanticColors.border.default`, `radius.md`, `boxShadow: none`
- Brand terra `#B46E57` for primary actions
- No purple/glow one-off UI; no fake success when APIs missing

## Forms

- `react-hook-form` + Zod + `@hookform/resolvers`
